# The deployed site is web/ and nothing else. Everything below is either huge, private,
# or reproduction material that belongs in the git repo but not on the CDN.

# The 8M checkpoints and their telemetry. The weights are gitignored, so a Git-connected deploy
# never sees them -- but a `vercel deploy` from this directory would happily upload all of it.
# Do not remove.
models/

node_modules/
.git/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Reproduction material: the scripts, the dossier, the training run record. Served from GitHub,
# not from the artifact's origin.
research/
vendor/
web/test/

# The README's screen captures and the built one-page summary: ~15 MB that belongs on GitHub,
# not on the artifact's CDN. Verified safe -- no page under web/ links to anything in docs/.
docs/

*.md
!README.md
